        "description": "PassRole is the single most common way attackers go from limited access to admin in real AWS environments. The trick: compute services (Lambda, EC2, Glue) will happily run under a powerful role if you are allowed to hand that role to them. This topic shows you exactly how the borrow works and how to shut it down.",
