        "description": "Every attack in this module has a defence, and the strongest defences are layered so that one mistake is not fatal. This topic turns the whole module around: you build a guardrail set that neutralises the escalations you just learned, then verify it by replaying your own earlier exploits and watching them fail. Defence you can test is defence you can trust.",
