        "description": "Secrets Manager and Parameter Store are only as safe as the policies around them. This topic opens the hood on exactly which permissions a read requires, how resource policies can accidentally expose secrets cross-account, and how staging labels and versioning work. You'll finish able to read, audit, and lock down a managed secret correctly.",
