        "number": 40,
        "title": "The VPC Model",
        "type": "theory",
        "week": 3,
        "description": "Before you can attack or defend anything in the cloud, you need to know where traffic can and cannot flow. A VPC is the private network that every cloud server, database and container lives inside, and a handful of simple rules decide what is reachable from where. Master these rules and you can predict exactly which doors an attacker can walk through.",
