        "type": "lab",
        "week": 3,
        "description": "This is the headline attack of cloud security: a seemingly minor web bug that makes a server fetch a URL becomes theft of the server's cloud credentials, and from there, the account. You will follow the chain end to end — the same chain behind the 2019 Capital One breach. By the end you will be able to both execute it in a lab and explain precisely why the modern defense breaks it.",
