        "description": "Serverless means you upload code and the cloud runs it on demand, with no server you log into or patch. That convenience does not delete risk, it relocates it into four places: your code, the event data that triggers the function, the IAM role the function runs as, and the dependencies baked in. This lesson teaches you to see those four surfaces so the rest of the module makes sense.",
