        "description": "A real cloud intrusion is not one magic exploit — it is a chain of small, legal-looking steps that an attacker links together from first foothold to final theft. This lesson gives you a single map of that whole journey and ties each stage to the industry-standard MITRE ATT&CK language defenders use. Once you can see the chain, you can see where to break it.",
