        "description": "Large organisations split their cloud into many accounts precisely to build walls between teams, environments, and blast radii. Attackers spend enormous effort climbing over those walls, because the trust relationships that let accounts cooperate are exactly what let a foothold in one account reach another. This lesson teaches you how those account boundaries are crossed — and the specific guardrails that hold them.",
