        "moduleId": "cloud-m12",
        "number": 77,
        "title": "Capstone: Secure the Estate",
        "type": "exercise",
        "week": 4,
        "description": "This is where everything connects. You inherit a deliberately broken, messy multi-account cloud estate and must act like a real cloud security engineer: find the genuine risks, prioritize by real-world impact, remediate the worst, and stand up guardrails so it stays fixed. This topic teaches the end-to-end workflow and how to present results in language executives understand.",
