        "description": "Google Cloud's identity model looks simple but behaves differently in two decisive ways: permissions **inherit down a resource hierarchy**, and **service accounts are first-class identities** that are both principals and resources you can be granted rights over. Those two facts drive the majority of GCP attack paths, so we build them carefully from zero.",
